the-firm-as-one-program-20 = unlines (cons "- **P9** Content-addressed, decentralized exchange of code with its proofs (hyperactivity v31 §10.8)." (cons "  A definition is identified by its content. A name is an alias, a change is a new object, and nothing is overwritten. Address identity, definitional equality and semantic equivalence are kept apart, and peers exchange constructions together with their proofs and dependency closures, with no global namespace and no canonical state (hyperactivity v31 §10.8)." nil))
